<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan 1996 export orders seen up 4-5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Taiwan 1996 export orders seen up 4-5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's export orders for all of 1996 are on track to grow four to five percent over those in 1995, the economics ministry said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The forecast by ministry economists was issued in a monthly report on the island's industrial and export trade performance.</p>
</text>
